  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When one queries the fcrepo-ldpath rest endpoint with a LD Path program that's invalid, a HTTP 500 Internal Server error is returned, along with a fairly long stack trace: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "output: ----\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "HTTP/1.1 500 Server Error",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=ISO-8859-1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Transfer-Encoding: chunked",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonMappingException: Infinite recursion (StackOverflowError) (through reference",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.std.BeanSerializerBase.serializeFields(BeanSerializerBase.java:694)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.BeanSerializer.serialize(BeanSerializer.java:157)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.BeanPropertyWriter.serializeAsField(BeanPropertyWriter.java:672)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.std.BeanSerializerBase.serializeFields(BeanSerializerBase.java:678)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.BeanSerializer.serialize(BeanSerializer.java:157)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.BeanPropertyWriter.serializeAsField(BeanPropertyWriter.java:672)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ser.std.BeanSerializerBase.serializeFields(BeanSerializerBase.java:678)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "a",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "---------------\r",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The error returned should be a 4xx error along with a clearer message as to what failed, in this case that the program was invalid. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The particular program that I used to cause this failure (the ::xsd:string is missing from the first variable assignment):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "----------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "@prefix dcterms : <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">  ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "subject = dcterms:subject / skos:prefLabel;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "altName = dcterms:subject / skos:altLabel ::xsd:string ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "----------\r",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
